{
  "label": "Bulk Lock & Unlock",
  "category": "Alert Acquirer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Bulk Lock & Unlock Management",
      "id": "bulk-lock-unlock",
      "intro": "Bulk Lock & Unlock memungkinkan investigator untuk lock atau unlock multiple alerts sekaligus. Lock alert mencegah investigator lain mengakses alert tersebut selama masih dalam penanganan.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa itu Bulk Lock & Unlock?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Bulk Lock**: Lock multiple alerts sekaligus untuk work session\n• **Bulk Unlock**: Unlock multiple alerts yang sudah selesai dihandle\n• Alert yang di-lock hanya bisa diakses oleh user yang lock\n• Mencegah conflict ketika multiple investigator handle alert sama\n• Support batch operation untuk efisiensi",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 50%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Bulk Lock & Unlock</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Batch Lock Management</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #10b981;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4\"/></svg>UNLOCKED</span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #ef4444;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4\"/></svg>LOCKED</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Bulk Lock - Lock Multiple Alerts",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Actions** → **Lock**\n• Page akan filter hanya tampilkan alerts yang:\n  - Belum di-lock (isLocked = false)\n  - Bisa di-lock oleh current user\n• Centang alerts yang ingin di-lock\n• Klik **Lock Selected (X)**\n• System akan process lock per alert\n• Show success/failed notification\n• Auto refresh list",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;background:linear-gradient(to right,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f59e0b;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">LOCK MODE</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Select alerts to lock</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">3 Selected</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12345</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Suspicious Transaction • Score: 85</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">UNLOCKED</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12346</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">High Risk Account • Score: 92</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">UNLOCKED</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Bulk Unlock - Unlock Multiple Alerts",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Actions** → **Unlock**\n• Page akan filter hanya tampilkan alerts yang:\n  - Sudah di-lock (isLocked = true)\n  - Di-lock oleh current user (lockedBy.id === currentUser.id)\n• User hanya bisa unlock alerts yang dia lock sendiri\n• Centang alerts yang ingin di-unlock\n• Klik **Unlock Selected (X)**\n• System process unlock per alert\n• Alert kembali available untuk investigator lain",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;background:linear-gradient(to right,#eef2ff,#f5f3ff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#6366f1;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">UNLOCK MODE</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Select alerts to unlock</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">2 Selected</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12340</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Locked by: Me • 2 hours ago</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">LOCKED (MINE)</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12341</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Locked by: Me • 1 hour ago</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">LOCKED (MINE)</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Single Lock/Unlock dari Detail",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Selain bulk mode, bisa juga lock/unlock single alert\n• Buka alert detail\n• Klik button **Lock** (jika unlocked) atau **Unlock** (jika locked by me)\n• Instant lock/unlock tanpa confirmation\n• Lock indicator akan update real-time\n• Lock info ditampilkan di alert card:\n  - 🔒 Red badge: Locked by others\n  - 🔓 Yellow badge: Locked by me\n  - ✅ Green badge: Unlocked",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12345 Details</span><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#8b5cf6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4\"/></svg>Lock</button></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ UNLOCKED</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Available to lock</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">This alert is not locked. You can lock it to prevent others from editing.</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">🔓 LOCKED (MINE)</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#78350f;\">Locked by: You</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#78350f;\">You have locked this alert. Click Unlock to release.</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">🔒 LOCKED</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#991b1b;\">Locked by: John Analyst</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#991b1b;\">This alert is locked by another user. You cannot modify it.</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Lock Behavior & Rules",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Alert yang locked hanya bisa diakses (read & write) oleh user yang lock\n• User lain bisa view tapi tidak bisa:\n  - Classify alert\n  - Add discussion\n  - Create action request\n  - Lock/unlock alert\n• Lock otomatis released jika:\n  - User unlock manual\n  - User logout (optional, tergantung config)\n  - Session timeout\n• Supervisor bisa force unlock alert user lain (permission required)",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdf4;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Lock Rules & Behavior</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14\"/><path d=\"M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#15803d;\">Allowed</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#166534;\">✓ View alert details<br/>✓ Classify & take action<br/>✓ Add discussion<br/>✓ Unlock (if mine)</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M15 9l-6 6M9 9l6 6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">Not Allowed (if locked by others)</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#991b1b;\">✕ Classify alert<br/>✕ Add discussion<br/>✕ Create action request<br/>✕ Unlock alert</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4M12 8h.01\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;\">Auto-Release</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#4338ca;\">• Manual unlock<br/>• User logout<br/>• Session timeout<br/>• Supervisor force unlock</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 6,
          "title": "Notification & Response",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Success Lock**: \"Successfully locked X alerts\"\n• **Success Unlock**: \"Successfully unlocked X alerts\"\n• **Partial Success**: Detail success/failed count dengan IDs\n• **Failed**: Error message dengan reason\n• Common failure reasons:\n  - Alert already locked by another user\n  - Alert sudah classified\n  - Permission denied\n• Alert list auto-refresh setelah bulk operation\n• Lock status badge update real-time",
          "color": "#ef4444",
          "bg": "#fef2f2",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803d;\">Locked Successfully</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#166534;margin-top:1px;\">Successfully locked 5 alerts</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803d;\">Unlocked Successfully</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#166534;margin-top:1px;\">Successfully unlocked 3 alerts</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Partial Lock</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#92400e;margin-top:1px;\">4 locked, 1 failed (#12345: Already locked)</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M15 9l-6 6M9 9l6 6\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">Lock Failed</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#991b1b;margin-top:1px;\">Cannot lock: Alert already locked by another user</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
